{"type":"theorem","type_name":"Theorem","number":"41.3.1","title":"Ignorability","title_html":"Ignorability","html":"<p>Suppose that</p>\n<div class=\"enumerate\" data-options=\"label=(\\roman*)\">\n<ol type=\"1\">\n<li><p>the mechanism is MAR at the realized <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbf{R},\\mathbf{D}_{\\mathrm{obs}})\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D411 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"2\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D403 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c62\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">R</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">D</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-auto-op=\"false\">obs</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> in the\nsense of <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"def-mis-mechanisms\">@def-mis-mechanisms</span>(b);</p></li>\n<li><p>the parameters are <strong>distinct</strong>: the parameter space\nof <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"(\\boldsymbol{\\uptheta},\\boldsymbol{\\uppsi})\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-utext style=\"font-size: 88.4%; padding: 0.848em 0 0.226em 0;\" variant=\"bold\">𝛉</mjx-utext></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\" space=\"2\"><mjx-utext style=\"font-size: 88.4%; padding: 0.848em 0 0.226em 0;\" variant=\"bold\">𝛙</mjx-utext></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">ψ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>\nis a product set <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\\times\\Psi\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c398\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cD7\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3A8\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Θ</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>,\nso that knowing one places no restriction on the other.</p></li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<p>Then the full likelihood factors, <span class=\"math display\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\nL_{\\mathrm{full}}(\\boldsymbol{\\uptheta},\\boldsymbol{\\uppsi})\n=L(\\boldsymbol{\\uptheta})\\cdot\nf(\\mathbf{R}\\mid\\mathbf{D}_{\\mathrm{obs}},\\boldsymbol{\\uppsi}),\n\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0;\" class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c66\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c75\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-utext style=\"font-size: 88.4%; padding: 0.848em 0 0.226em 0;\" variant=\"bold\">𝛉</mjx-utext></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\" space=\"2\"><mjx-utext style=\"font-size: 88.4%; padding: 0.848em 0 0.226em 0;\" variant=\"bold\">𝛙</mjx-utext></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-utext style=\"font-size: 88.4%; padding: 0.848em 0 0.226em 0;\" variant=\"bold\">𝛉</mjx-utext></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D411 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2223\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"4\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D403 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c62\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\" space=\"2\"><mjx-utext style=\"font-size: 88.4%; padding: 0.848em 0 0.226em 0;\" variant=\"bold\">𝛙</mjx-utext></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-auto-op=\"false\">full</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">ψ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">R</mi></mrow><mo>∣</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">D</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-auto-op=\"false\">obs</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">ψ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>{#eq-mis-factorization}</p>\n<p>and consequently:</p>\n<div class=\"enumerate\" data-options=\"label=(\\alph*)\">\n<ol type=\"1\">\n<li><p>the maximizer of <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"L_{\\mathrm{full}}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c66\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c75\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-auto-op=\"false\">full</mi></mrow></mrow></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> in <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol{\\uptheta}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-utext style=\"font-size: 88.4%; padding: 0.848em 0 0.226em 0;\" variant=\"bold\">𝛉</mjx-utext></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">θ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is the maximizer of\n<span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"L\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, and likelihood ratio statistics\nfor hypotheses about <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol{\\uptheta}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-utext style=\"font-size: 88.4%; padding: 0.848em 0 0.226em 0;\" variant=\"bold\">𝛉</mjx-utext></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">θ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> alone are the same\nunder both;</p></li>\n<li><p>if the prior is <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"p(\\boldsymbol{\\uptheta},\\boldsymbol{\\uppsi})\n=p(\\boldsymbol{\\uptheta})p(\\boldsymbol{\\uppsi})\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-utext style=\"font-size: 88.4%; padding: 0.848em 0 0.226em 0;\" variant=\"bold\">𝛉</mjx-utext></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\" space=\"2\"><mjx-utext style=\"font-size: 88.4%; padding: 0.848em 0 0.226em 0;\" variant=\"bold\">𝛙</mjx-utext></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-utext style=\"font-size: 88.4%; padding: 0.848em 0 0.226em 0;\" variant=\"bold\">𝛉</mjx-utext></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-utext style=\"font-size: 88.4%; padding: 0.848em 0 0.226em 0;\" variant=\"bold\">𝛙</mjx-utext></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">ψ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">ψ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, the posterior\nof <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol{\\uptheta}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-utext style=\"font-size: 88.4%; padding: 0.848em 0 0.226em 0;\" variant=\"bold\">𝛉</mjx-utext></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">θ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> given\n<span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbf{D}_{\\mathrm{obs}},\\mathbf{R})\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D403 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c62\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D411 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">D</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-auto-op=\"false\">obs</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">R</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>\nequals its posterior given <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{D}_{\\mathrm{obs}}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D403 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c62\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">D</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-auto-op=\"false\">obs</mi></mrow></mrow></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> alone, computed\nfrom <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"eq-mis-observed-likelihood\">@eq-mis-observed-likelihood</span>;</p></li>\n<li><p>if in addition the MAR condition holds at every <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbf{R},\\mathbf{D}_{\\mathrm{obs}})\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D411 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"2\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D403 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c62\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">R</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">D</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-auto-op=\"false\">obs</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, the\nobserved-data score has mean zero and the usual maximum likelihood\nasymptotics (<span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"thm-opt-mle\">@thm-opt-mle</span>) apply to <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"L\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> under the ordinary regularity\nconditions.</p></li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<p>A mechanism satisfying (i) and (ii) is called\n<strong>ignorable</strong>.</p>","file":"ch41-missing-data/03-likelihood.html"}